                <h1 id="privacy-heading">Privacy Policy</h1>
                <p class="updated">Last updated: July 7, 2026</p>

                <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">The Café is a catering and meal prep business in
                    Leavenworth, Kansas. This page explains, in plain language, what information we
                    collect about you, why we collect it, and how to ask us about it. The short
                    version: we collect only what we need to feed you, we never sell it, and you can
                    ask us to remove it at any time.</p>

                <h2>What we collect and why</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Contact and inquiry forms</strong> — your name, email, phone number,
                        and event details. We use these only to respond to you and plan your order.</li>
                    <li><strong>Orders</strong> — what you ordered, when it's needed, and a delivery
                        address if we're bringing it to you. We keep order history so repeat orders
                        are easy and so we can answer questions about past ones.</li>
                    <li><strong>Meal delivery clients</strong> — for customers who receive regular
                        meal deliveries, our staff may keep a record on their behalf: name, address,
                        phone, an emergency contact, and any dietary notes. These records exist only
                        so we can deliver the right meal safely, and only our staff can see them.</li>
                    <li><strong>Newsletter signups</strong> — your email address, and your phone
                        number only if you choose to give it. We email you our news and menus; we
                        won't text you unless you've checked the box that says we may.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>What we don't do</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>We never sell or rent your information to anyone.</li>
                    <li>We don't collect payment card numbers on this website. When card payments
                        are offered, they are handled by a payment processor (such as Square), and
                        card details go to them directly — never to us.</li>
                    <li>We don't use advertising trackers on this site.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>Who else touches your data</h2>
                <p>A few trusted services help this website run, and each receives only what it
                    needs to do its job:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Formspree</strong> delivers our form submissions to our email.</li>
                    <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> provides the lettering on this site; loading a
                        font shares your browser's request with Google, like loading any web page does.</li>
                    <li><strong>Our email newsletter provider</strong> stores the newsletter list and
                        handles unsubscribes. Every newsletter includes an unsubscribe link that works.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>How long we keep things</h2>
                <p>Inquiries and order records are kept while you're a customer and for a reasonable
                    period afterward for bookkeeping. Newsletter information is kept until you
                    unsubscribe. Records for meal delivery clients are removed when service ends and
                    they're no longer needed.</p>

                <h2>Your choices</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>Ask us what information we have about you.</li>
                    <li>Ask us to correct it or delete it. We'll honor deletion requests except where
                        we need a record for legal or bookkeeping reasons, and we'll tell you if so.</li>
                    <li>Unsubscribe from the newsletter at any time using the link in any email.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>How to reach us</h2>
                <p>Questions or requests about your information: call
                    <a href="tel:+19135479994">(913) 547-9994</a> or email
                    <a href="mailto:theabcafe@gmail.com">theabcafe@gmail.com</a>.
                    <!-- TODO: confirm contact details + legal business name with client --></p>

                <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">If this policy changes, we'll update this page and
                    the date at the top.</p>
